WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.370
♪♪

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.371
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:07.139
Today was
International Women's Day,

00:00:07.139 --> 00:00:08.441
while yesterday belonged

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:12.311
to a woman who decided to stop
being international.

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:14.313
Britain's Prince Harry
and Duchess Meghan Markle

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:17.250
sat down for an interview
last night with Oprah Winfrey,

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.686
or, as British tabloids
reported it...

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:24.724
So, last night, Meghan Markle
was interviewed by Oprah

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.458
and I wanted to do
a whole piece about it,

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:29.161
but we ran out of time.
-Well, how much time do we have?

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:30.963
-One minute.
-That's all the time I need.

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:32.432
-Both:
Start the clock!

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.768 line:0%
-First of all, if you thought
they were going to come on TV

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:37.637 line:0%
and not really spill the tea,
then you would be wrong as butt,

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:39.405 line:0%
because they said everything.

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:40.874 line:0%
So, like they were both like,

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.076 line:0%
"It's not the Queen
who was racist.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:44.610 line:0%
It's this group of people
who run the monarchy

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:45.845 line:0%
called The Firm,"
and I was like,

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.012 line:0%
"Are you talking
about that rap group

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:48.281 line:0%
with Nas and Foxy Brown in it?"

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:49.448 line:0%
Then I don't know
who The Firm is.

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:50.817 line:0%
Also, someone here is racist,

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:52.284 line:0%
and it's not
the ancient white woman?

00:00:52.284 --> 00:00:53.853 line:0%
Okay!
-41 seconds!

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:55.755 line:0%
-So, Meghan said that,
when tabloids said

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.423 line:0%
that she made Kate cry,
that that was a lie.

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:59.125 line:0%
Kate really was the one
who made her cry.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.560 line:0%
But no one in the monarchy
stood up for her.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.462 line:0%
Can you stand it?!
-31 seconds!

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:05.464 line:0%
-Okay, so Meghan Markle said,
"When I was pregnant

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:06.833 line:0%
with Archie, people
were concerned about

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.701 line:0%
how dark the baby would be."

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:09.902 line:0%
And Oprah was like,
"Who said that?"

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:11.236 line:0%
And she was like,
"I will not say."

00:01:11.236 --> 00:01:12.772 line:0%
And you best believe that was
the right thing to do,

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:15.207 line:0%
because let me catch who said
that and see what happens!

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:16.275 line:0%
-You're going
to run out of time!

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:17.443 line:0%
-I can make it!
I can make it!

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:19.912 line:0%
Okay, they took away
their security detail.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:23.082 line:0%
And then, of all the people
in the entire world,

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:25.718 line:0%
it was Tyler Perry who let them
stay in his house.

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:27.319 line:0%
Harry got cut off!

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:29.588 line:0%
They're having
a little, bitty baby girl!

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:33.059 line:0%
Piers Morgan is insane now
and will be forever!

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.660 line:0%
-That's it!
Amber Ruffin, everybody.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:35.728 line:0%
Give it up for Amber.

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:39.098 line:0%
[ Applause ]

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:42.201
And, now, she's going
to slowly scoot away.

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:43.403
Oh, no, she's not.
Alright.

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:44.704
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:46.973
The Senate on Saturday passed
President Biden's

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:49.875
$1.9 trillion
coronavirus relief package,

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:52.612
which includes
a $1,400 stimulus check,

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.480
so go out and buy yourself
something nice,

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.382
like November's rent.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:59.118
The NBA All-Star Game was held
in Atlanta last night,

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:01.287
though, if they hold
an all-star game in Atlanta

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.388
and the players can't go
to strip clubs,

00:02:03.388 --> 00:02:04.624
did it really happen?

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:05.792
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.659
Billionaire philanthropist
MacKenzie Scott

00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:09.095
has reportedly remarried,

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:12.632
following her 2019 divorce
from Amazon founder Jeff Bezos,

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.166
and, to add insult to injury,

00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:16.202
the registry is on eBay.

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.603
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:20.272
Nine apes at the San Diego Zoo
recently became

00:02:20.272 --> 00:02:23.209
the first nonhumans to receive
the coronavirus vaccine,

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.577
which is pretty amazing.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.846
How'd they figure out
the website?

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.614
[ Laughter ]
That's right, nine apes

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:29.782
at the San Diego zoo

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:32.818
recently received
the coronavirus vaccine, so,

00:02:32.818 --> 00:02:34.520
I guess they can come over now?

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.355
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:37.523
I mean, I'll take it.

00:02:37.523 --> 00:02:38.925
♪♪

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:42.829
President Biden's dog Major
was reportedly sent back

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:45.498
to the Biden family home
in Delaware last week

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.767
after biting a member
of White House security.

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:50.169
See, under the last
administration,

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:52.805
that kind of behavior would've
made you press secretary.

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:53.839
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.839 --> 00:02:54.940
That's right, President Biden's

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.410
two dogs, Champ and Major,

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:58.811
were moved back to Delaware

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:00.646
after aggressive behavior
at the White House.

00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:03.516
And, yes, Oprah will be
interviewing them

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:05.084
next Sunday at 8:00 pm.

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:06.084
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.084 --> 00:03:07.219
The Justice Department

00:03:07.219 --> 00:03:09.289
is reportedly investigating
connections

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:11.591
between a recently arrested
Capitol rioter

00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:13.259
and former President Trump's

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.561
longtime friend and advisor
Roger Stone.

00:03:15.561 --> 00:03:19.198
Oh, well, I hope they're able
to connect the dot.

00:03:19.198 --> 00:03:20.432
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.432 --> 00:03:21.968
It was announced yesterday
that President Biden

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:24.203
will deliver a prime time
address on Thursday

00:03:24.203 --> 00:03:27.073
to mark the one-year anniversary
of the coronavirus lockdown.

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.575
Then, on Friday,
he will deliver an address

00:03:29.575 --> 00:03:33.313
to mark the one-year anniversary
of everyone downloading Duolingo

00:03:33.313 --> 00:03:35.648
and never opening it again.

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:37.750
A bipartisan group
of lawmakers is set

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:40.886
to introduce legislation
this week calling for research

00:03:40.886 --> 00:03:43.723
into the coronavirus pandemic's
impact on mental health.

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:45.891
[ Laughing ]
Well, let me save you
a few bucks.

00:03:45.891 --> 00:03:47.493
It's been bad!

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:50.396
This morning I cried
because capital I's

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:53.232
are so frequently confused
for lowercase L's.

00:03:53.232 --> 00:03:55.234
I cried.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:57.569
A pastor in Missouri
has taken a leave of absence

00:03:57.569 --> 00:03:59.639
after he told women
in a recent sermon that,

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:02.474
while not everyone can look
like Melania Trump,

00:04:02.474 --> 00:04:05.644
"You don't need to look
like a butch, either."

00:04:05.644 --> 00:04:08.147
[ Laughter ]
So it wasn't a leave of absence,

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:10.149
so much as a sprint
for his life.

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:11.150
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:12.485
Chicago mayor Lori Lightfoot

00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:14.653
announced yesterday
that the Cubs and White Sox

00:04:14.653 --> 00:04:16.055
will be able
to fill their stadiums

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:18.324
at 20% capacity on Opening Day,

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:19.758
or, as the Mets call that,

00:04:19.758 --> 00:04:21.027
an attendance record.

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:23.329
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:25.798
Things may turn around, Steve,
but until they do...

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:27.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.169
there'll be
a steady dose of those.

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:32.105
Trump's gone, Steve!
We don't have much!

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:35.574
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.574 --> 00:04:37.610
According to a new report,
dozens of people

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.044
at a Florida vaccination site

00:04:39.044 --> 00:04:41.246
falsely claimed
they were healthcare workers

00:04:41.246 --> 00:04:43.015
to receive
the coronavirus vaccine,

00:04:43.015 --> 00:04:47.153
though the local Halloween store
had its biggest March ever.

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:49.221
Facebook CEO Mark Zuckerberg
said yesterday

00:04:49.221 --> 00:04:51.456
that smart glasses could help
fight climate change,

00:04:51.456 --> 00:04:52.558
by replacing the need

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:54.260
for in-person meetings
and gatherings.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.629
Kind of the way
Facebook replaced the need

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.564
for in-person bullying.

00:04:58.564 --> 00:05:00.466
According to reports,
the controversial

00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:02.835
Looney Tunes character
Pepé Le Pew

00:05:02.835 --> 00:05:04.803
will not be featured
in "Space Jam 2,"

00:05:04.803 --> 00:05:08.174
a move that has really angered
some conservatives.

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:10.175
[ Laughter ]

00:05:10.175 --> 00:05:12.378
That's right, the Looney Tunes
character Pepé Le Pew

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:15.014
will not be featured
in "Space Jam 2."

00:05:15.014 --> 00:05:16.516
He's been #MePew-ed.

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:18.351
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.351 --> 00:05:20.920
Scollins, Amber.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.054
Scollins wrote that.

00:05:22.054 --> 00:05:23.790
Can we send

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.092
some Seamless food
to Scollins' apartment?

00:05:26.092 --> 00:05:27.359
[ Laughter ]

00:05:27.359 --> 00:05:29.228
And have the delivery guy
slap him?

00:05:29.228 --> 00:05:33.165
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.165 --> 00:05:36.102
The infamous Times Square
Naked Cowboy

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:37.770
was arrested in Florida
over the weekend

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.672
while performing
at a motorcycle rally.

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:41.874
Though, if you're a guy
in tighty-whities

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:44.176
playing acoustic guitar
at a biker rally,

00:05:44.176 --> 00:05:47.679
getting arrested is probably
the best-case scenario.

00:05:47.679 --> 00:05:50.416
According to a new survey,
65% of Americans say

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:52.618
that they sneak
healthy ingredients

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:54.420
into food for their loved ones.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.889
Well, that explains
hot dog night.

00:05:56.889 --> 00:05:58.590
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.590 --> 00:05:59.925
Finally, scientists --

00:05:59.925 --> 00:06:01.394
That was Scollins,
as well, Steve.

00:06:01.394 --> 00:06:03.429
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:05.431
He's the Mets
of "Late Night" writers.

00:06:05.431 --> 00:06:07.933
[ Laughter ]

00:06:07.933 --> 00:06:11.103
And, finally, scientists have
discovered that injured slea --

00:06:11.103 --> 00:06:13.940
injured sea slugs, excuse me --

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.675
injured sea slugs
are able to grow new hearts

00:06:16.675 --> 00:06:18.777
and regenerate
entirely new bodies

00:06:18.777 --> 00:06:19.945
and, in some cases,

00:06:19.945 --> 00:06:21.213
even a mullet.

00:06:21.213 --> 00:06:22.581
♪♪

00:06:22.581 --> 00:06:24.116
President Biden announced today

00:06:24.116 --> 00:06:26.552
that he secured
100 million more doses

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:29.054
of the Johnson &amp; Johnson
coronavirus vaccine,

00:06:29.054 --> 00:06:31.423
though it might be
too little, too late,

00:06:31.423 --> 00:06:34.994
unless they can be administered
via Jell-O.

00:06:34.994 --> 00:06:36.962
When asked by a reporter
yesterday

00:06:36.962 --> 00:06:40.032
if President Biden's dog Major
would be euthanized

00:06:40.032 --> 00:06:42.501
after biting a member of the
White House security staff,

00:06:42.501 --> 00:06:44.670
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.406
confirmed he will not
be put down.

00:06:47.406 --> 00:06:50.176
But the reporter refused
to let it go.

00:06:50.176 --> 00:06:52.044
[ Laughter ]

00:06:52.044 --> 00:06:54.280
I should stress,
these are never Photoshopped.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.114
[ Laughter ]
We get animals in here.

00:06:56.114 --> 00:06:58.651
We make the tiny hats.

00:06:58.651 --> 00:07:01.921
It takes up the biggest chunk
of our day.

00:07:01.921 --> 00:07:04.223
The House passed
the $1.9 trillion

00:07:04.223 --> 00:07:05.591
coronavirus relief bill today.

00:07:05.591 --> 00:07:07.593
Democrats are calling it
a landmark bill

00:07:07.593 --> 00:07:09.395
that will give Americans
desperately needed

00:07:09.395 --> 00:07:11.397
financial assistance
during a pandemic,

00:07:11.397 --> 00:07:12.965
while Republicans are calling it

00:07:12.965 --> 00:07:15.835
"not what Dr. Seuss
would've wanted."

00:07:15.835 --> 00:07:18.137
The New York Times published
a profile yesterday

00:07:18.137 --> 00:07:20.273
on Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:07:20.273 --> 00:07:23.042
and even Schumer
only made it halfway through.

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:25.044
[ As Schumer ]
We get it. I'm boring.

00:07:25.044 --> 00:07:26.946
According to a new profile
in The New York Times,

00:07:26.946 --> 00:07:28.447
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:07:28.447 --> 00:07:30.850
cried so hard watching
the movie "Free Willy"

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:33.719
that his daughters left the
theater out of embarrassment.

00:07:33.719 --> 00:07:37.023
Meanwhile, Mitch McConnell
threw a harpoon at the screen.

00:07:37.023 --> 00:07:38.023
[ Laughter ]

00:07:38.023 --> 00:07:39.025
[ As McConnell ]
That blubber is

00:07:39.025 --> 00:07:41.460
a valuable source of energy.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.962
Ha, ha, ha, ha.

00:07:43.962 --> 00:07:45.731
I'll get you, whale!

00:07:45.731 --> 00:07:46.832
[ Laughter ]

00:07:46.832 --> 00:07:47.900
President Biden is scheduled

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.134
to meet virtually on Friday

00:07:49.134 --> 00:07:51.336
with the leaders of Japan,
India, and Australia

00:07:51.336 --> 00:07:54.640
to discuss climate change
and the coronavirus pandemic,

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.542
and they'll be relieved
to finally talk

00:07:56.542 --> 00:07:59.545
to a U.S. president who doesn't
interrupt every few minutes

00:07:59.545 --> 00:08:02.748
to ask, "So what time is it
where you are?"

00:08:02.748 --> 00:08:04.049
A new study has concluded that,

00:08:04.049 --> 00:08:06.219
due to the steep reduction
in traffic,

00:08:06.219 --> 00:08:09.688
Boston is no longer the most
congested city in the country.

00:08:09.688 --> 00:08:11.123
And, if you're wondering
what happened,

00:08:11.123 --> 00:08:14.092
literally everyone's license
is suspended.

00:08:14.092 --> 00:08:15.461
[ Laughter ]
[ Boston accent ] DUI?

00:08:15.461 --> 00:08:16.462
"Yeah, you?"

00:08:16.462 --> 00:08:17.463
Yeah!

00:08:17.463 --> 00:08:18.530
[ Laughter ]

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.199
A murder suspect in California

00:08:20.199 --> 00:08:22.701
was mistakenly released
from jail yesterday

00:08:22.701 --> 00:08:24.369
due to a data entry error.

00:08:24.369 --> 00:08:26.539
"Dibs!" said Netflix.

00:08:26.539 --> 00:08:28.441
And, finally, according
to The Washington Post,

00:08:28.441 --> 00:08:30.809
people deprived
of physical intimacy

00:08:30.809 --> 00:08:32.311
due to the coronavirus pandemic

00:08:32.311 --> 00:08:34.580
are signing up to hug cows

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.615
at sanctuaries
across the country.

00:08:36.615 --> 00:08:39.652
So, I don't know.
Maybe try that?

00:08:39.652 --> 00:08:41.020
♪♪

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:42.855
Well, it's been exactly one year

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:44.957
since we've had an audience
and I got to say,

00:08:44.957 --> 00:08:47.226
I really miss the laughs,
the energy,

00:08:47.226 --> 00:08:50.295
and, of course,
keeping the lost wallets.

00:08:50.295 --> 00:08:51.663
[ Laughter ]
President Biden delivered

00:08:51.663 --> 00:08:53.165
his first prime time
address today

00:08:53.165 --> 00:08:56.001
to speak about the past year
and present a hopeful vision

00:08:56.001 --> 00:08:58.003
of America's return to normal

00:08:58.003 --> 00:09:02.240
and then, Republicans were given
30 minutes for a rebuttal.

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:05.177
The Senate yesterday confirmed
Judge Merrick Garland

00:09:05.177 --> 00:09:07.579
as attorney general and so,

00:09:07.579 --> 00:09:11.884
Merrick Garland's long con
finally pays off.

00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:13.386
"All I got to do is wait

00:09:13.386 --> 00:09:14.987
for a Supreme Court
justice to die,

00:09:14.987 --> 00:09:16.488
get nominated to replace them,

00:09:16.488 --> 00:09:18.423
but Mitch is never going
to let that happen

00:09:18.423 --> 00:09:19.591
during an election year,

00:09:19.591 --> 00:09:20.959
so then, I just wait
for Hillary to win.

00:09:20.959 --> 00:09:23.195
But what they don't know
is she loses.

00:09:23.195 --> 00:09:24.597
So then, I wait four more years,

00:09:24.597 --> 00:09:26.531
while some idiot appoints
three more justices,

00:09:26.531 --> 00:09:28.233
but then, when he screws up
the pandemic and loses,

00:09:28.233 --> 00:09:29.335
I get a pretty cool job.

00:09:29.335 --> 00:09:30.469
Not as good, but pretty cool,

00:09:30.469 --> 00:09:31.570
from the next guy.

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:34.072
Merrick, you're a genius!"
[ Laughter ]

00:09:34.072 --> 00:09:35.908
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell said yesterday

00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:38.744
that the enhanced security
around the Capitol

00:09:38.744 --> 00:09:41.546
in the wake of January's attack
reminds him of his

00:09:41.546 --> 00:09:43.616
"last visit to Kabul."

00:09:43.616 --> 00:09:45.317
You mean Kabul, Afghanistan,

00:09:45.317 --> 00:09:47.553
where the democratic government
had to be protected

00:09:47.553 --> 00:09:49.488
from the terrorist faction
whipped into a frenzy

00:09:49.488 --> 00:09:51.990
by misinformation and a twisted
view of their own religion?

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.026
Yeah, I guess I can see that.

00:09:54.026 --> 00:09:57.429
President Biden signed
the $1.9 trillion --

00:09:57.429 --> 00:09:58.430
we got "million" up there.

00:09:58.430 --> 00:09:59.665
I don't think that
would've done it.

00:09:59.665 --> 00:10:02.467
[ Laughter ]

00:10:02.467 --> 00:10:04.937
I think, Wally -- Let's take
a shot of Wally there,

00:10:04.937 --> 00:10:06.038
with the "1-point-9 million."

00:10:06.038 --> 00:10:07.440
That's what the Republicans
voted for.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.875
-Yeah, yeah,
that's what I was hoping for.

00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:11.076
-President Biden signed

00:10:11.076 --> 00:10:14.380
the $1.9 trillion
coronavirus relief bill today.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.916
Finally!
Those dudes in "Uncut Gems"

00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:19.117
didn't have to wait this long
for their money.

00:10:19.117 --> 00:10:20.285
[ Italian accent ]
It's coming! It's coming!

00:10:20.285 --> 00:10:21.520
I just need a couple more days.

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.122
I got Syria breathing
down my neck.

00:10:23.122 --> 00:10:25.191
Apparently, my dog bit a guy.
It's been a rough week.

00:10:25.191 --> 00:10:26.224
[ Laughter ]

00:10:26.224 --> 00:10:28.260
In response
to a reporter's question,

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.896
Britain's Prince William
said that the royal family is

00:10:30.896 --> 00:10:33.432
"very much not a racist family."

00:10:33.432 --> 00:10:34.667
Then he clarified --

00:10:34.667 --> 00:10:37.203
[ As William ]
We hate all of you equally.

00:10:37.203 --> 00:10:38.770
[ Laughter ]
In a new statement
released yesterday,

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:41.173
former President Trump said
that Americans likely

00:10:41.173 --> 00:10:44.309
wouldn't have the coronavirus
vaccine, if it weren't for him,

00:10:44.309 --> 00:10:47.079
and added,
"I hope everyone remembers!"

00:10:47.079 --> 00:10:49.682
But the one he released today
was even sadder.

00:10:49.682 --> 00:10:50.816
[ Laughter ]

00:10:50.816 --> 00:10:53.185
Former President Trump's
son-in-law Jared Kushner

00:10:53.185 --> 00:10:54.854
is reportedly planning
to write a book

00:10:54.854 --> 00:10:56.555
about his work
in the Trump administration.

00:10:56.555 --> 00:10:57.823
Look for it in bookstores,

00:10:57.823 --> 00:11:01.227
sometime after the statute
of limitations runs out.

00:11:01.227 --> 00:11:02.628
According to the latest numbers,

00:11:02.628 --> 00:11:04.262
the world's
largest theater chain,

00:11:04.262 --> 00:11:08.967
AMC Entertainment,
lost $4.6 billion in 2020

00:11:08.967 --> 00:11:10.269
and experts say it could take

00:11:10.269 --> 00:11:12.938
up to ten large popcorns
to make it back.

00:11:12.938 --> 00:11:14.072
[ Laughter ]

00:11:14.072 --> 00:11:16.809
Former First Lady Michelle Obama
said,

00:11:16.809 --> 00:11:19.378
in a recent interview, that she
and former President Obama

00:11:19.378 --> 00:11:22.047
"never want to experience
winter again."

00:11:22.047 --> 00:11:23.381
Said a woman in Florida,

00:11:23.381 --> 00:11:26.085
"But what can you do
when the winter is inside you?"

00:11:26.085 --> 00:11:27.953
[ Laughter ]

00:11:27.953 --> 00:11:31.056
And, finally, the streaming
service Disney+ this week

00:11:31.056 --> 00:11:33.125
made several classic movies
unavailable

00:11:33.125 --> 00:11:35.127
to children
under seven years old

00:11:35.127 --> 00:11:37.529
because they depict
racist stereotypes,

00:11:37.529 --> 00:11:39.231
but adults can still find them

00:11:39.231 --> 00:11:40.933
under Walt's Favorites!

00:11:40.933 --> 00:11:42.467
[ Laughter ]

00:11:42.467 --> 00:11:43.835
Told you it was worth
sticking around.

00:11:43.835 --> 00:11:45.370
That was the monologue,
everybody.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:49.274 line:0%
♪♪

00:11:49.274 --> 00:11:50.609 line:0%
[ Whistling and applause ]

